{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I run a small investment advisory firm with 3 employees helping clients invest in stocks and bonds. Do I need to register with the Retirement Benefits Authority, or is that only for pension fund managers?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "The Retirement Benefits Authority's mandate is to regulate and supervise the establishment and management of retirement benefits schemes — that is, formal pension and retirement savings plans. Your investment advisory firm advising individual clients on stock and bond purchases falls outside this scope. However, if you're helping clients set up or manage employer-sponsored retirement schemes or group pension arrangements, then you'd be dealing with the RBA's jurisdiction. For your specific situation, confirm with the RBA whether your advisory activities trigger any registration requirements under their framework."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb1_legal_regulatory", "task_type": "analysis", "source_filename": "doing_business_kenya_sectors.txt", "source_text": "dealer-licesnse-checklist&id=51:licensing-checklists&Itemid=241 Authorized Depository https://www php?option=com_phocadownload&view=category&download=472:authorized-depositories-checklist&id=51:licensing-checklists&Itemid=241 CMA Sandbox https://www ke/images/sandbox/Capital-Markets-Authority-Regulatory-Sandbox-Application-Form pdf Retirement Benefit Authority Retirement Benefits Authority is mandated to: Regulate and supervise the establishment and management of retirement benefits schemes; Pro"}}
{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I run a small retail shop in Nairobi with 2 employees. We're thinking about using an online payment system to collect payments from customers. Based on Kenya's regulatory framework, what should I know about integrating a payment collection system into my business?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "When you integrate a payment collection system, you need to understand that Kenya has established digital payment infrastructure through platforms like eCitizen, which shows the government's commitment to digital transactions. Any payment system you use should be capable of providing real-time details on your users, transactions, and the services you're issuing—this transparency is important for your record-keeping and tax compliance. Look for a payment aggregator or collection engine that can be customised to fit your specific business needs and can integrate smoothly with however you currently track sales. The key is ensuring whatever system you choose gives you complete visibility into your transaction data so you can accurately report your revenue. I'd recommend confirming with your tax authority or the Central Bank of Kenya which payment service providers are approved and what reporting requirements apply to your revenue collection method."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb1_legal_regulatory", "task_type": "analysis", "source_filename": "pesaflow_bookkeeping_2026.txt", "source_text": "etails on users, transactions and services issued real-time. Full customisation and dynamic integrations Custom payments collection engine can be configured and plugged in as a payment aggregator. Proud Achievements Key Project: eCitizen Kenya eCitizen has been highlighted as one of The Government of Kenya’s most successful projects in several platforms, including the State House website and several of the President’s speeches on public holidays. KES 345 Billion + Amount of revenue collected to"}}
