{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm a sole proprietor running a small hardware retail shop in Nairobi with 2 employees. I've been operating informally for about a year and a customer asked if my business is registered anywhere. Do I need to register with the Business Registration Service, and what would that involve?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes, you should register your business. The Business Registration Service (BRS) is the government office that oversees business registration in Kenya. As a sole proprietor, you need to register to operate formally and legally. Registration gives your business official standing and makes it easier to access services like bank loans, supplier credit, and contracts. Once registered through BRS, your business will be recorded in the Companies Registry, which is the official record of registered businesses in Kenya. This formal registration also protects you because it separates your personal liability from your business liability. Since you're currently informal, registering now will help you comply with tax obligations, access better financing options, and protect yourself legally. Contact the Business Registration Service directly to start the registration process for your hardware shop."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb1_legal_regulatory", "task_type": "analysis", "source_filename": "doing_business_kenya_sectors.txt", "source_text": "attorney general Business Registration Service (BRS) is mandated to oversee the operations of the Companies Registry, Movable Property Security Rights Registry (Collateral Registry), Insolvency (Official Receivers) Registry and the Hire Purchase Registry php Kenya Investment Authority Kenya Investment Authority (KenInvest) is a statutory body established in 2004 through an Act of Parliament (Investment Promotion Act No 6 of 2004) with the main objective of promoting investments in Kenya It is r"}}
