{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I run a small online retail shop from my home in Nairobi selling clothes. I have 2 employees who help with packing and customer service. Do I need to register for any digital or trade-related requirements in Kenya?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I cannot generate a complete and accurate response based on the source material provided. The text fragment appears to be corrupted HTML/CSS code rather than substantive regulatory content about digital or trade requirements for Kenyan MSMEs. To give you proper guidance on registration requirements for your online retail business, I would need access to the relevant regulatory framework covering business registration, digital commerce, and employment obligations in Kenya. I recommend contacting the Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA) for tax registration requirements, the Registrar of Companies for business registration, and the Ministry of Labour for employment compliance to confirm what applies to your specific operation."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb5_digital_trade", "task_type": "analysis", "source_filename": "kplc_tiered_tariff_msme_guide.txt", "source_text": "ft-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;color:rgba(var(--kubio-color-5),1);padding-top:8px;padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:25px;padding-right:24px;}[data-kubio] input[type='button']:hover,[data-kubio] button:where(:not(.wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle):not(.wp-block-navigation-submenu__toggle):not(.wc-block-mini-cart__button):not(.wp-block-woocommerce-accordion-header .accordion-item__toggle)):hover{background-color:rgba(var(--kub"}}
