{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I run a small online retail shop selling clothes from my home in Nairobi. I have 2 employees who help me pack and ship orders. What digital trade regulations or requirements do I need to follow?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm unable to provide specific guidance on this question based on the available information. The source material provided appears to be corrupted or incomplete and does not contain substantive content about digital trade regulations for Kenyan MSMEs. To get accurate advice on your online retail obligations—including consumer protection, data handling, e-commerce registration, and employment requirements—you should contact the Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA) for tax compliance matters, the Communications Authority of Kenya for digital commerce standards, or the Business Registration Service for formalization requirements."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb5_digital_trade", "task_type": "analysis", "source_filename": "krb_strategic_plan.txt", "source_text": "adding:3em;}@media (max-width:921px){ post-author-avatar{margin-bottom:1em;} ast-blog-featured-section{float:none;} ast-blog-featured-section:first-child ast-blog-featured-section:first-child ast-blog-featured-section:first-child post-thumb-img-content{margin-top:-1 post-thumb-img-content{margin-left:-2 post-thumb-img-content:first-child{margin-top:-1 post-thumb-img-content{margin-left:-2 ast-blog-featured-section:first-child ast-blog-featured-section:first-child ast-blog-featured-section:first-"}}
