{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm running a small tailoring shop in Nairobi with 3 employees. We do custom clothing repairs and alterations for walk-in customers. What cultural or contextual factors should I be aware of when managing my business and dealing with customers in Kenya?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I appreciate the question, but the source material I have available doesn't contain readable content on cultural or contextual business practices for Kenyan MSMEs. To give you solid, practical advice on managing customer relationships, workplace communication, or cultural sensitivities specific to your tailoring business in Kenya, I'd need access to clear guidance on those topics. I'd recommend speaking directly with the Kenya National Bureau of Standards (KNBS), your local county business office, or a business association for tailors — they can advise you on best practices that align with local expectations and professional standards in your sector."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb7_culture_context", "task_type": "analysis", "source_filename": "kenya_national_climate_change_action_plan.txt", "source_text": ")\u0013�n��I \u0013���*1\u0013h؈� �ױ\u0010\u0000 �\u000fA^e��� \u0007�i�P�ڣ�'��fD4��\\ �J�9��\u0006�;t\u0001����U£Q\u0004� 1�7 #k�K�� 6Ub\u0018��\u0018MXj+D\u000e�c�Rdl���� �5�$V��u�v��#[\u001b\\�\u0006��h\u0000T�&���]�j� T�]��f5�7�ժ�\"f�\u0000�u�ʡ\u0002���P�� \u0000\u001afW\b5\u0018�ԁ\u0014\\$Tm�*\u0011E1�p�U0n,Qt�+�58� U �H��C\u0014M\u0016�CXP�M�\u0004]:��A�eJ�q�\u0005\u0004QJw�\u0006݊0q��TE-Pc\\$�Bq(�ʃ�<\u0010�G�$� YP�\bB\"���\u001b+��)��pa��\u000e\"�b\u000e^��? }��e���\u0000\u0014��\u0014g[��(\u0003BY�:�� ��b���6���7@\u0015Y�\u0002; ��d�+#7G�`�/\u0006�u��\u0011�l�EP�a�E�.�\u0007�9�g�\u0007���չ�\u001b��n��4��#\u000fcCH{]R �F�L�\u0015�Q�a 1��k�| �:\u000eC�r���\"��2�m{d��$s[t\u0013��T|h=��\