{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "What are the key support structures and social protection mechanisms available to businesses operating in Kenya at the county and national levels?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Kenya has established social protection and data structures that support businesses across counties and at the national level. The framework includes county-based social protection systems with continuous improvement in data collection and utilization, supported by dedicated structures and personnel. At both county and national levels, there are operational capacities in place—including community work programs and support systems—designed to strengthen social protection infrastructure. These structures work together to create an enabling environment for business operations by ensuring social safety nets and data-driven support systems are available to MSMEs and their workers. You may want to confirm the specific programs applicable to your business type with your county government or the national social protection authority."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb7_culture_context", "task_type": "summarization", "source_filename": "ndma_strategic_plan_2023_2027.pdf", "source_text": "tnuoc PNSH .02 troppuS .11 detroppus ,noitcelloc dna noitazilitu suounitnoc tnemevorpmi -ytnuoc fo laicos desab noitcetorp atad RDDD STD 81 71 61 51 51 052 052 052 052 052 052 CWB fo .oN 81serutcurts PS .12 troppuS .21 detroppus ,GWTCC ,CWB( snoitarepo )CSPSN ,GWTPSC seiticapac dna RDDD STD 52.1 52.1 52.1 1 1 9 9 9 8 8 8 GWTCC fo .oN detroppus laicos fo detroppus noitcetorp serutcurts RDDD STD 52.1 52.1 52.1 1 1 9 9 9 8 8 8 GWTPSC fo .oN ,lanoitan ta detroppus dna ytnuoc RDDD STD 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1"}}
