{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "What are the key points I need to understand about culture and context when running my business in Kenya?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I'm unable to provide you with accurate guidance on this topic. The source material I have access to appears to be corrupted or unreadable, and I cannot extract clear, reliable information about culture and context requirements for Kenyan MSMEs. To get proper advice on how cultural considerations affect your business operations, I recommend speaking directly with your local county business office, a registered business advisor, or the Kenya National Chamber of Commerce and Industry."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb7_culture_context", "task_type": "summarization", "source_filename": "kenya_national_climate_change_action_plan.txt", "source_text": "\bH$��τ!7��L!\u0000$�\u0010\u0002L!\u0000$ȓ\u0000!\b@&\u0010�\u0000�\"L\u0000�!\u0000$�\u0010\u0002\u0010�\u0000!\b@\bBL\u0000�!\u0000!\b@ 0�\u0000�!\u0000$�\u0010\u0002\u0010�\u0000�!\u0000$ȓ\u0000!\b@\bB\u0010\u0002\u0010�\u0000�$�\"\u0010�\u0000�!\u0000!\b@\bB\u0010\u0002\u0010�\u0002!&D\u0000�!\u0000!\b@\"\u0010�\u0000�B\u0010\u0002\u0010�\u0002!\b@\bB\u0010\b�!\u0000$I�\u0002!\b@\"\u0012d@ \u0012a\u0000�B\u0012A\u0010�\b\u0004B\u0010�D! \u0000�I�$\u0011 2 \u0011\bB\b\"\u0012d@ \u0012d@ \u0012d@\bB\u0010I��τ$��0�$�\bBL�\u0010�$\u0000�\b@ 0�\u0000�$�\bB\u0010\u0002L!$\u0004! \u0000$�\u0010\u0002\u0010�\u0000!\b@\bB\u0010 �!\u0000! 0\b�\b@\bB\u0010\u0002\u0010�\u0000!\b@\bBL\u0002!&\u0010\b��@\bB\u0010\u0002\u0010�\u0000�&\u0010\b��@\"\u0012a\u0000�BL\u0002!\b@\bB\u0010\u0002\u0010�\u0000�&D\u0000�!\u0000$I�\u0002!\b@ \u0012a\u0000�I�\u0000$I�\u0002!\b@ \u0012a\u0000�B\u0012A\u0010�\"@\bB\u0012A\u0010� \u0011 2 \u0004�0�\b�!$\u0011\"L�\u0001\"L �$I�\u0002!&D\u0012D$Ȁ\u0012$�\b?�ԡ\bBo1�\bB\u0000I�