{"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant advising Kenyan MSME operators on tax, registration, financing, and regulatory compliance."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm thinking about taking a skills course to improve my business. Can you give me a checklist of the Level 3 technical programmes available at Nyeri National Polytechnic that I could enrol in?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are the Level 3 technical programmes you can enrol in at Nyeri National Polytechnic:\n\n**Construction & Building Skills**\n- Tiling\n\n**Clothing & Fashion**\n- Gents Wear Outfits\n- Ladies Wear Outfits\n\n**Automotive & Mechanics**\n- Motorcycle Mechanics\n- Motor Vehicle Mechanics\n- Motor Vehicle Electrics\n\nEach of these is a Level 3 qualification. If you're running a retail shop or small business and want to diversify into trades or improve technical skills for a service-based venture, any of these could be worth exploring. Contact Nyeri National Polytechnic directly to confirm current enrolment dates, fees, and whether they offer flexible scheduling for working business owners."}], "_meta": {"kb_id": "kb7_culture_context", "task_type": "drafting", "source_filename": "tveta_tvet_courses_list.txt", "source_text": "Polytechnic View Institutions 275 Tiling Level 3 The Nyeri National Polytechnic View Institutions 276 Gents Wear Outfits Level 3 The Nyeri National Polytechnic View Institutions 277 Ladies Wear Outfits Level 3 The Nyeri National Polytechnic View Institutions 278 Motorcycle Mechanics Level 3 The Nyeri National Polytechnic View Institutions 279 Motor Vehicle Mechanics Level 3 The Nyeri National Polytechnic View Institutions 280 Motor Vehicle Electrics Level 3 The Nyeri National Polytechnic View I"}}
